      "writtenOn": "2019-08-09T00:11:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: Should this be a uint16_t to match \"template_max\" (https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/refs/heads/master/include/ec_commands.h#5644) ?\n\nNot that we\u0027ll ever actually have that many, but if they\u0027re symmetric hopefully it will help reduce some casting in biod. Though there is a ton of casting happening (before your change), so use your best judgement.",
